{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1514362-ahroun-auspice-filled-out-character-sheet-w5-preview","id":1514362,"title":"Ahroun Auspice & Filled Out Character Sheet - W5 Preview","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-09T17:36:24-07:00","id":1514362,"title":"Ahroun Auspice & Filled Out Character Sheet - W5 Preview","content":"<div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"1229\" height=\"783\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y7zDZfT.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y7zDZfT.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y7zDZfT.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"424\" height=\"838\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AlIOAXA.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/AlIOAXA.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/AlIOAXA.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> <br /> So many thoughts on the filled-out character sheet (didn't bother putting in the blank character sheet) and what it says about the system but for now, here's what was shared on the stream.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:05:16-07:00","id":1514365,"title":"","content":"Samantha Jack?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:11:16-07:00","id":1514366,"title":"","content":"I assume it's a character from one of the playtesters... I mean, &quot;Impulsive comedian with a complicated relationship&quot; is... certainly a choice for a Garou character (especially a Black Fury character who's focused on injustice).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:14:29-07:00","id":1514367,"title":"","content":"Rage checks feel like they're going to be very frequent if Garou are still going to be action heavy, but don't have quick regen any more. Crinos has the Gauru time-bomb from Forsaken. Gifts that have to beat a difficulty 3+ are going to suck if Gifts are all Attribute + Renown since you're not starting with great dice-pools the way things look.<br /> <br /> Not much we didn't know or at least suspect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:16:41-07:00","id":1514368,"title":"","content":"The recent Gift analysis places the system for Hare's Leap as rookie numbers. Curse of Aeolus, too, seems like it should just provide full soft cover, rather than a dice pool penalty.<br /> <br /> Shifting into other forms doesn't seem to be something that you can manage with effort the same way as before, and it is also annoyingly bound tightly to Rage in a way that it didn't have to be. Guess that the Rite of Rain and Clouds will have to wait in this iteration, too, even though it seems like it could slot in with its Rage system in a way that actually matters (pun intended).<br /> <br /> The utter simplicity of the Ahroun auspice as presented, of course, as well as the fact that, like the other glyphs, its resembles a path to trace on Elite Beat Agents more than a quick method of communication from one wolf monster to another.<br /> <br /> Getting rid of Gnosis was a mistake. It seems to have completely stripped a dimension from the depth of the Garou, (again, pun intended), and it doesn't seem like the game is served by making you track Harano and Hauglosk but not the single, contrasting trait of Gnosis. If you're going to flatten the systems to simplify them, you could just make Gnosis important for staving those feelings off. Instead, we have no traversable spirit world, which is likely to prevent certain tribes from really differentiating themselves from each other, and degeneration mechanics from personal horror that the game was never conceptualized to service. Once again, not just a conceptual Abomination that's more interested in being like Vampire than Werewolf, but also a travesty fueled by the Rite of Sacred Rebirth, utilizing the stolen skins of Apocalypse and Forsaken.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:20:56-07:00","id":1514369,"title":"","content":"Anyone else think the Ahroun art looks like Drax from the Guardian of the Galaxy movies?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:24:36-07:00","id":1514370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1514362-ahroun-auspice-filled-out-character-sheet-w5-preview?p=1514369#post1514369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone else think the Ahroun art looks like Drax from the Guardian of the Galaxy movies?</div> </div> </div> </div>nah,the ahroun has a different face","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:25:40-07:00","id":1514371,"title":"","content":"The difficulty of those Gifts and Rites... we're right back to one of the issues with Edges in H5. And it really incentivizes picking an Auspice that complements the Renown of the Tribe you're playing, so that you can get a slightly bigger dicepool for your Gifts and Rites. And I assume this game also allows you to add Rage-dice to your Gift/Rite-rolls... which is then yet another source of potentially triggering Rage.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm not sure if there's a mistake there but the Favor of the Black Furies is yet another version of Favor and the best one yet. In this case, it's just a flat dice-bonus to any action that opposes or circumvents someone in a position of power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:38:06-07:00","id":1514372,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1514362-ahroun-auspice-filled-out-character-sheet-w5-preview?p=1514369#post1514369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone else think the Ahroun art looks like Drax from the Guardian of the Galaxy movies?</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean...based on every other piece of art we've seen its certainly traced from somewhere but not Drax....I'm getting celebrating athlete vibe or WWE..though the face does have that The Hills Have Eyes look....we'll see in a few days when someone finds it.<br /> <br /> Edit. Make that 1 hour. Yes, that is absolutely a trace of Drax, he combined a number of different angles to try and disguise the face somewhat but the body and neck are a direct trace. I'll link the comparison images once they are up on Twitter.<br /> <br /> Is it just me or is some of the syntax 'off' in that excerpt? Shouldn't it be ' looked to' not 'looked at' and the sentence structure is very ' 12 year old boy'...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":479,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","user":"Damian May","date":". 06-09-2023, 09:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:43:36-07:00","id":1514374,"title":"","content":"Fuck...its a 'Rage Check' to transform....so based on our 12 month run with V5 there are going to be 2-3 Veil breaches per night and most of our times gonna be spent cleaning up murder scenes and erasing memories instead of just turning into a giant fucking wolf, (oh...wait hispo are just big dog size now aren't they?...which makes them larger or smaller than lupus depending on the subspecies of wolf? ) and tracking the mockery....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":479,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","user":"Damian May","date":". 06-09-2023, 09:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:50:39-07:00","id":1514376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1514362-ahroun-auspice-filled-out-character-sheet-w5-preview?p=1514371#post1514371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The difficulty of those Gifts and Rites... we're right back to one of the issues with Edges in H5. And it really incentivizes picking an Auspice that complements the Renown of the Tribe you're playing, so that you can get a slightly bigger dicepool for your Gifts and Rites. And I assume this game also allows you to add Rage-dice to your Gift/Rite-rolls... which is then yet another source of potentially triggering Rage.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm not sure if there's a mistake there but the Favor of the Black Furies is yet another version of Favor and the best one yet. In this case, it's just a flat dice-bonus to any action that opposes or circumvents someone in a position of power.</div> </div> </div> </div>The flat bonus would definitely be the smart way to do all the Favors.....but smart doesn't seem to be the way this has been going so far.<br /> <br /> Adding Rage dice to Rites and Gifts makes zero sense in-world so I can definitely see them doing it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:52:34-07:00","id":1514377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1514362-ahroun-auspice-filled-out-character-sheet-w5-preview?p=1514374#post1514374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fuck...its a 'Rage Check' to transform....so based on our 12 month run with V5 there are going to be 2-3 Veil breaches per night and most of our times gonna be spent cleaning up murder scenes and erasing memories instead of just turning into a giant fucking wolf, (oh...wait hispo are just big dog size now aren't they?...which makes them larger or smaller than lupus depending on the subspecies of wolf? ) and tracking the mockery....</div> </div> </div> </div>Well the \u201cSpend 1 Willpower per turn of Frenzy\u201d seems to indicate Crinos won\u2019t last very long so it\u2019s got that going for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T18:59:44-07:00","id":1514378,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1514362-ahroun-auspice-filled-out-character-sheet-w5-preview?p=1514377#post1514377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well the \u201cSpend 1 Willpower per turn of Frenzy\u201d seems to indicate Crinos won\u2019t last very long so it\u2019s got that going for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yay?<br /> <br /> I just want to fucking weep at the utter ineptitude.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm also confused at the apparent lack of a Pack Patron.......its kinda the heart of the entire Found Family aspect of WtA, taking that out just leaves things kinda hollow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T19:02:38-07:00","id":1514380,"title":"","content":"Also between the language used in the character history, the mention in the touchstone section humans can\u2019t be touch stones if turned into a werewolf, and the Ahroun mention of \u201cChanged under the sign of the full moon\u201d, I\u2019m getting a vibe being a Garou is not something you\u2019re born with and its something that happens to you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T19:06:48-07:00","id":1514382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1514362-ahroun-auspice-filled-out-character-sheet-w5-preview?p=1514380#post1514380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also between the language used in the character history, the mention in the touchstone section humans can\u2019t be touch stones if turned into a werewolf, and the Ahroun mention of \u201cChanged under the sign of the full moon\u201d, I\u2019m getting a vibe being a Garou is not something you\u2019re born with and its something that happens to you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, we already know that you are the auspice of the moon you First Change under not the moon you are born under and that ' Kin' ( the W5 term for pre-Change Garou) can live perfectly normal lives until they are Exalted/Triggered etc. into Garou.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T19:11:12-07:00","id":1514383,"title":"","content":"Ah I missed that part","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T22:17:36-07:00","id":1514396,"title":"","content":"As a general thought: Isn't it striking how this character-sheet thinks 8 lines is more than enough for a PC to list all the Gifts and Rites of their character...? That suggests that 1 ) any werewolf-PC will never accumulate a great number of them, 2 ) their power-level is generally low (and probably unbalanced in the same way Edges in H5 were, like Asset-Edges were bad but the Global Access Edge turned your character into a super-hacker) and 3 ) that the number of Gifts and Rites listed in the book might be low as well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1514362-ahroun-auspice-filled-out-character-sheet-w5-preview?p=1514376#post1514376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The flat bonus would definitely be the smart way to do all the Favors.....but smart doesn't seem to be the way this has been going so far.<br /> <br /> Adding Rage dice to Rites and Gifts makes zero sense in-world so I can definitely see them doing it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, this Favor just confirms what the WOD-team failed to do with five Creeds in H5, they once again failed to do with eleven Favor/Ban-pairings...<br /> <br /> The only reason I think you can add Rage-dice because difficulty 4 and even 5 are listed there. How else would anyone ever hope to beat those difficulties at the start of the game after all?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is it just me or is some of the syntax 'off' in that excerpt? Shouldn't it be ' looked to' not 'looked at' and the sentence structure is very ' 12 year old boy'... </div> </div> </div>Not just that, the Ahroun-one also doesn't turn the (infamous) verbs into short phrases of example-actions like the other Auspice-bits we've seen before. Also, this write-up doesn't talk about the Apocalypse (which may have something to do with why Septs could be &quot;bellicose&quot;... you know just as a bit of context the writer could've mentioned that would tie this to the actual game of W5)...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Make that 1 hour. Yes, that is absolutely a trace of Drax, he combined a number of different angles to try and disguise the face somewhat but the body and neck are a direct trace. I'll link the comparison images once they are up on Twitter. </div> </div> </div>Once the book comes out I think it will be quicker to merely list the art that <i>isn't</i> a rushed tracing of a stock-photo or some other photo-reference...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T23:16:24-07:00","id":1514399,"title":"","content":"So both Homid AND Lupus are silver immune no regardless of breed. Also, that is one TINY Rage pool for a game about Rage dice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T23:22:19-07:00","id":1514401,"title":"","content":"Well, now that we had V5 becoming street level and adopting concepts like blood potency and touchstones, H5 which is a powerless cell game ala The Vigil, and now W5 with time limited crinos, focus on local territory story, hostile umbra, etc, I think the theory that the devs actually wanted to make a CofD line rather than a Wod one is basically proven.<br /> <br /> Guess M5 will be about a gnostic fight with the technocracy, with characters divided in paths. And wraith 5th will be Geist without having a corporal body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T23:49:49-07:00","id":1514404,"title":"","content":"Is that dave bautista?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T23:53:59-07:00","id":1514405,"title":"","content":"\u200bSo uh... wtf is this section.<img width=\"1195\" height=\"348\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ObFkqO7.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/ObFkqO7.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/ObFkqO7.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T00:00:28-07:00","id":1514408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1514362-ahroun-auspice-filled-out-character-sheet-w5-preview?p=1514405#post1514405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bSo uh... wtf is this section.</div> </div> </div> </div>It says &quot;Crinos&quot;, right? The person on the stream didn't mention it, so who knows...<br /> <br /> Design-wise I also don't get why it looks like that. There isn't anything else on these two pages that is like that. It feels like something someone haphazardly quickly added with an image-editing-software.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T00:01:30-07:00